    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0577" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg507"/>

                <head>No. 299.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. West to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-06-21"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 21, 1883</date>.
                        (Received June 22.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to Mr. Davis’s notes of the
                    7th and 10th ultimo, I have the honor to inclose copy of an approved report of a
                    committee of the privy council of Canada relative to the stealing by Canadian
                    Cree Indians of a number of horses on the Teton River, Montana.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>L. S. SACKVILLE WEST.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d299-a1.xml" xpointer="d299-a1"/>
            </div>
